    "created_at": "2016-03-09T15:03:48Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-03-09T15:03:48Z",
    "body": "It is a very useful feature (or would be if implemented everywhere).\nI haven't seen any proposal to replace accessKeyLabel with something else so I don't understand why it should be removed. If there was such proposal, I could reconsider.\n\nAnd I don't understand chaals comment about parseable. accessKeyLabel doesn't really need to be easily parseable, unless someone is misusing it.\n",
