    "created_at": "2018-08-03T11:09:38Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-08-03T11:09:38Z",
    "body": "It sounds like we should indeed close this issue, given an existing implementation in Gecko and support from WebKit in https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/838#issuecomment-409757748.\r\n\r\nI see that there aren't any tests at all for this in wpt except the idlharness.js coverage. @smaug----, are there any tests in Gecko that could be shared? I ask mostly because if such a test is added and remains passing in only Firefox a few years down the line, that would be a signal to again revisit the issue.",
