    "body": "How long before this issue might be re-examined? I ask because the feature was specified a decade ago, the Chromium bug wasp opened 4 years ago, this issue was opened 2 years ago, and there is little evidence that implementation is likely.\r\n\r\n(To be clear, I think the proposal is an improvement to the platform, for all that I think it is not the optimal improvement. But outside Firefox it seems like it is still just a proposal after all that time).",
